        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-COSMO-CB\"><b>Laurey Cosmopolitan Champagne Brass Chrome Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Champagne Brass Cosmopolitan Cabinet Pull is available in a few sizes for small and large cabinet doors. The Cosmopolitan Champagne Brass Cabinet Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. The sleek design is great for modern kitchen remodels. And it is easy to care for!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Cosmopolitan Champagne Brass Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Champagne Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-73010:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\" (96mm)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-73110:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\" (128mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-73210:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 6-1/4\" (160mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-73310:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 7-1/2\" (192mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-73410:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 10\" (256mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
